{"id":"u17","kelas":8,"no":8,"judul":"Aturan dan Saran","title":"Rules and Advice","emoji":"🚦","ringkas":"Modal verbs: must, mustn't, should, may, have to","ready":true,"goals":["memakai **modal verb**: [[must]], [[mustn't]], [[should]], [[shouldn't]], [[may]], [[can]]","menyatakan **kewajiban** dan **larangan** (aturan sekolah dan lalu lintas)","memberi dan meminta **saran**","meminta **izin** dengan sopan: [[May I ...?]] dan [[Can I ...?]]","membedakan [[must]] dan [[have to]], serta [[mustn't]] dan [[don't have to]]"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"Bagaimana mengatakan \"kamu **harus** memakai seragam\", \"kamu **sebaiknya** minum air\", atau \"**bolehkah** aku ke toilet?\" Semuanya memakai **modal verb**. Di **Unit 8** kamu belajar memakai modal untuk aturan, saran, dan izin."},{"t":"grammar","title":"1. Ciri modal verb","text":"Modal verb adalah kata bantu seperti **can, must, should, may, will**. Tiga ciri penting:","table":[["Ciri","Contoh"],["Setelah modal, kata kerja berbentuk **dasar** (tanpa to, tanpa -s)","[[She must go.]] bukan *She must goes*"],["Tidak berubah untuk semua subjek","[[I should / he should / they should]]"],["Pertanyaan: modal dipindah ke depan","[[Should I go?]]"],["Negatif: tambah **not**","[[must not (mustn't)]], [[should not (shouldn't)]]"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"2. Must dan mustn't: kewajiban dan larangan","table":[["Bentuk","Arti","Contoh"],["**must**","harus (wajib)","[[You must wear a uniform.]]"],["**mustn't**","dilarang / tidak boleh","[[You mustn't use your phone in class.]]"]],"examples":[{"en":"[[Students must arrive before 7 a.m.]]","id":"Siswa harus tiba sebelum pukul 7 pagi."},{"en":"[[You mustn't run in the corridor.]]","id":"Kamu tidak boleh berlari di koridor."}]},{"t":"grammar","title":"Have to dan don't have to","text":"**Have to** artinya hampir sama dengan must (harus). Tetapi **don't have to** artinya **tidak perlu**, berbeda dengan mustn't (dilarang)!","table":[["Bentuk","Arti","Contoh"],["have to / has to","harus","[[I have to finish my homework.]]"],["**don't / doesn't have to**","tidak perlu (boleh tetapi tidak wajib)","[[You don't have to bring a pen. We have extra pens.]]"],["**mustn't**","dilarang (tidak boleh)","[[You mustn't cheat.]]"]]},{"t":"warn","title":"Mustn't ≠ don't have to","text":"**You mustn't go** = kamu **dilarang** pergi. **You don't have to go** = kamu **tidak perlu** pergi (boleh pergi, boleh tidak). Artinya sangat berbeda!"},{"t":"grammar","title":"3. Should dan shouldn't: saran","table":[["Bentuk","Arti","Contoh"],["**should**","sebaiknya","[[You should drink more water.]]"],["**shouldn't**","sebaiknya tidak","[[You shouldn't stay up late.]]"],["Meminta saran","","[[What should I do?]] / [[Should I take medicine?]]"]],"examples":[{"en":"[[I have a headache.]] — [[You should take a rest.]]","id":"Kepalaku sakit. — Sebaiknya kamu istirahat."}]},{"t":"grammar","title":"4. May dan can: meminta izin","table":[["Ungkapan","Arti","Contoh"],["**May I ...?**","Bolehkah saya ...? (sangat sopan)","[[May I go to the toilet, please?]]"],["**Can I ...?**","Bolehkah aku ...? (biasa)","[[Can I borrow your pen?]]"],["Mengizinkan","[[Yes, you may.]] / [[Sure, go ahead.]] / [[Yes, of course.]]","Ya, silakan."],["Tidak mengizinkan","[[I'm sorry, you can't.]] / [[No, you may not.]]","Maaf, tidak boleh."]]},{"t":"vocab","title":"5. Aturan di sekolah dan jalan (Rules and signs)","items":[{"en":"Wear a uniform.","id":"Pakai seragam.","ex":"You must wear a uniform."},{"en":"Be on time.","id":"Tepat waktu.","ex":"You must be on time."},{"en":"No littering.","id":"Dilarang membuang sampah.","ex":"You mustn't litter."},{"en":"No smoking.","id":"Dilarang merokok.","ex":"You mustn't smoke here."},{"en":"Keep quiet.","id":"Jaga ketenangan.","ex":"You must keep quiet in the library."},{"en":"Stop.","id":"Berhenti.","ex":"You must stop at a red light."},{"en":"No parking.","id":"Dilarang parkir.","ex":"You mustn't park here."},{"en":"Wear a helmet.","id":"Pakai helm.","ex":"You must wear a helmet."}]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog: Aturan dan saran","lines":[{"who":"Teacher","en":"Class, you must finish your homework by Friday.","id":"Anak-anak, kalian harus menyelesaikan PR sebelum Jumat."},{"who":"Budi","en":"May I use a dictionary, Miss?","id":"Bolehkah saya memakai kamus, Bu?"},{"who":"Teacher","en":"Yes, you may. But you mustn't use your phone.","id":"Ya, boleh. Tapi kalian tidak boleh memakai ponsel."},{"who":"Rani","en":"I feel tired today. What should I do?","id":"Hari ini aku merasa lelah. Apa yang sebaiknya kulakukan?"},{"who":"Budi","en":"You should go to bed early and you shouldn't drink coffee at night.","id":"Sebaiknya kamu tidur lebih awal dan jangan minum kopi di malam hari."}]},{"t":"summary","items":["Setelah modal: **kata kerja dasar**. Tidak ada -s, tidak ada to.","[[must]] = harus. [[mustn't]] = **dilarang**. [[don't have to]] = **tidak perlu**.","[[should]] = sebaiknya. [[shouldn't]] = sebaiknya tidak. Dipakai untuk saran.","Izin: [[May I ...?]] (sopan), [[Can I ...?]] (biasa)."]}],"practice":[{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan modal dengan artinya:","pairs":[["must","harus"],["mustn't","dilarang"],["should","sebaiknya"],["shouldn't","sebaiknya tidak"],["may","boleh / bolehkah"]],"exp":"Modal punya makna yang berbeda-beda."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["She must goes to school.","She must go to school.","She must to go to school.","She musts go to school."],"answer":1,"exp":"must + kata kerja dasar."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["You should to drink water.","You should drinks water.","You should drink water.","You should drinking water."],"answer":2,"exp":"should + kata kerja dasar."},{"type":"fill","id":"Kamu harus memakai helm.","q":"You ___ wear a helmet.","answers":["must"],"hint":"m _ _ _","exp":"Kewajiban → must."},{"type":"fill","id":"Kamu dilarang membuang sampah di sini.","q":"You ___ litter here.","answers":["mustn't","must not"],"hint":"mustn't / must ?","exp":"Larangan → mustn't."},{"type":"fill","id":"Sebaiknya kamu beristirahat.","q":"You ___ take a rest.","answers":["should"],"hint":"s _ _ _ _ _","exp":"Saran → should."},{"type":"mcq","q":"\"You don't have to wear a tie.\" artinya...","options":["Kamu dilarang memakai dasi.","Kamu tidak perlu memakai dasi.","Kamu harus memakai dasi.","Kamu sebaiknya memakai dasi."],"answer":1,"exp":"don't have to = tidak perlu."},{"type":"mcq","q":"\"You mustn't talk in the library.\" artinya...","options":["Kamu tidak perlu bicara.","Kamu tidak boleh bicara di perpustakaan.","Kamu harus bicara.","Kamu boleh bicara."],"answer":1,"exp":"mustn't = dilarang."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Cara paling sopan untuk meminta izin ke toilet adalah...","options":["Toilet now!","May I go to the toilet, please?","I go toilet.","You let me go."],"answer":1,"exp":"May I ...? sangat sopan."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kamu sakit kepala. Saran yang baik dari temanmu adalah...","options":["You should take a rest.","You must go to the zoo.","You may play football.","You mustn't sleep."],"answer":0,"exp":"Should untuk saran."},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Kamu tidak boleh berlari di koridor.\"","answer":"You mustn't run in the corridor.","exp":"Subjek + mustn't + kata kerja dasar + ..."},{"type":"order","q":"Susun pertanyaan: \"Bolehkah aku meminjam penamu?\"","answer":"Can I borrow your pen?","exp":"Can I + kata kerja dasar + ...?"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Jawaban yang tepat untuk \"May I come in?\" (mengizinkan) adalah...","options":["Yes, you may.","Yes, I may.","Yes, you do.","Yes, I am."],"answer":0,"exp":"May I ...? → Yes, you may."},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa aturannya?","say":"You must wear a uniform on Monday","options":["Harus memakai seragam hari Senin","Dilarang memakai seragam hari Senin","Sebaiknya memakai seragam hari Senin","Tidak perlu memakai seragam hari Senin"],"answer":0,"exp":"must = harus."},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa sarannya?","say":"You shouldn't stay up late","options":["Sebaiknya jangan begadang","Harus begadang","Dilarang tidur","Boleh begadang"],"answer":0,"exp":"shouldn't = sebaiknya tidak; stay up late = begadang."},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan rambu dengan artinya:","pairs":[["No smoking","Dilarang merokok"],["Keep quiet","Jaga ketenangan"],["Wear a helmet","Pakai helm"],["No parking","Dilarang parkir"],["Be on time","Tepat waktu"]],"exp":"Rambu dan aturan."},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan modal dengan fungsinya:","pairs":[["must","kewajiban"],["mustn't","larangan"],["should","saran"],["may","izin"]],"exp":"Fungsi modal."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["You must wear a uniform.","You must wearing a uniform.","You must to wear a uniform.","You musts wear a uniform."],"answer":0,"exp":"must + kata kerja dasar."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["He should see a doctor.","He should sees a doctor.","He should to see a doctor.","He shoulds see a doctor."],"answer":0,"exp":"should + kata kerja dasar."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["You mustn't cheat in the exam.","You mustn't to cheat in the exam.","You don't must cheat in the exam.","You mustn't cheating in the exam."],"answer":0,"exp":"mustn't + kata kerja dasar."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih pertanyaan yang benar.","options":["Should I take medicine?","Do I should take medicine?","Should I to take medicine?","I should take medicine?"],"answer":0,"exp":"Should + subjek + kata kerja dasar?"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih pertanyaan yang benar.","options":["May I go out, please?","May I going out, please?","May I to go out, please?","Do I may go out, please?"],"answer":0,"exp":"May I + kata kerja dasar?"},{"type":"mcq","q":"\"Students must be on time\" artinya...","options":["Siswa harus tepat waktu.","Siswa dilarang tepat waktu.","Siswa tidak perlu tepat waktu.","Siswa sebaiknya terlambat."],"answer":0,"exp":"must = harus."},{"type":"mcq","q":"\"You don't have to pay\" artinya...","options":["Kamu tidak perlu membayar.","Kamu dilarang membayar.","Kamu harus membayar.","Kamu sebaiknya membayar."],"answer":0,"exp":"don't have to = tidak perlu."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Sakit gigi. Saran yang baik adalah...","options":["You should see a dentist.","You must eat candy.","You mustn't see a dentist.","You may eat more ice."],"answer":0,"exp":"Saran: ke dokter gigi."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kamu sedang lelah. Saran dari temanmu adalah...","options":["You should go to bed early.","You must run fast.","You shouldn't sleep.","You may stay up late."],"answer":0,"exp":"Saran istirahat."},{"type":"fill","id":"Kamu harus memakai sabuk pengaman.","q":"You ___ wear a seat belt.","answers":["must"],"hint":"m _ _ _","exp":"must."},{"type":"fill","id":"Sebaiknya kamu minum air.","q":"You ___ drink water.","answers":["should"],"hint":"s _ _ _ _ _","exp":"should."},{"type":"fill","id":"Kamu tidak boleh makan di kelas.","q":"You ___ eat in class.","answers":["mustn't","must not"],"hint":"mustn't","exp":"mustn't."},{"type":"fill","id":"Bolehkah aku bertanya?","q":"___ I ask a question?","answers":["may","can"],"hint":"m _ _","exp":"May I ...?"},{"type":"fill","id":"Sebaiknya kamu tidak begadang.","q":"You ___ stay up late.","answers":["shouldn't","should not"],"hint":"shouldn't","exp":"shouldn't."},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Kamu harus mengerjakan PR.\"","answer":"You must do your homework.","exp":"You + must + kata kerja dasar."},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Sebaiknya kamu pergi ke dokter.\"","answer":"You should go to the doctor.","exp":"You + should + kata kerja dasar."},{"type":"order","q":"Susun pertanyaan: \"Bolehkah aku meminjam bukumu?\"","answer":"May I borrow your book?","exp":"May I + kata kerja dasar?"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa aturannya?","say":"You mustn't use your phone in class","options":["Dilarang memakai ponsel di kelas","Harus memakai ponsel di kelas","Sebaiknya memakai ponsel","Boleh memakai ponsel"],"answer":0,"exp":"mustn't = dilarang."},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa sarannya?","say":"You should drink warm water","options":["Sebaiknya minum air hangat","Dilarang minum air hangat","Harus minum air hangat","Boleh minum air dingin"],"answer":0,"exp":"should = sebaiknya."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca: \"School Rules. 1. Students must wear a uniform. 2. Students must be on time. 3. Students mustn't use phones in class. 4. Students should keep the classroom clean.\" Apa yang dilarang?","options":["Memakai ponsel di kelas","Memakai seragam","Tepat waktu","Menjaga kebersihan"],"answer":0,"exp":"mustn't use phones."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca teks aturan di atas. Mana yang hanya saran?","options":["Menjaga kelas tetap bersih","Memakai seragam","Tepat waktu","Tidak memakai ponsel"],"answer":0,"exp":"should = saran."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca: \"At the swimming pool: You must take a shower before swimming. You mustn't run. You shouldn't eat before swimming.\" Apa yang wajib dilakukan sebelum berenang?","options":["Mandi","Makan","Berlari","Tidur"],"answer":0,"exp":"must take a shower."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca dialog: A: \"May I borrow your pen?\" B: \"___\"","options":["Yes, of course.","Yes, you must.","Yes, I may.","Yes, you should."],"answer":0,"exp":"mengizinkan."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca dialog: A: \"I have a headache.\" B: \"You should ___.\"","options":["take a rest","to take a rest","takes a rest","taking a rest"],"answer":0,"exp":"should + kata kerja dasar."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana kalimat yang SALAH?","options":["You mustn't to cheat.","You mustn't cheat.","You should study.","You must come."],"answer":0,"exp":"tanpa to."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana kalimat yang SALAH?","options":["She should goes to bed early.","She should go to bed early.","He should drink water.","They should rest."],"answer":0,"exp":"should + kata kerja dasar."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana kalimat yang SALAH?","options":["May I to leave?","May I leave?","Can I leave?","May I go out?"],"answer":0,"exp":"May I + kata kerja dasar."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Terjemahan \"Kamu tidak perlu membawa buku\" adalah...","options":["You don't have to bring a book.","You mustn't bring a book.","You can't bring a book.","You should not bring book."],"answer":0,"exp":"don't have to."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Terjemahan \"Dilarang membuang sampah\" adalah...","options":["You mustn't litter.","You don't have to litter.","You should litter.","You may litter."],"answer":0,"exp":"mustn't."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata yang tidak sama kelompoknya adalah...","options":["helmet","must","should","may"],"answer":0,"exp":"helmet = benda."},{"type":"fill","id":"Kamu harus memakai seragam.","q":"You ___ wear a uniform.","answers":["must"],"hint":"m _ _ _","exp":"must."},{"type":"fill","id":"Sebaiknya kamu makan sayur.","q":"You ___ eat vegetables.","answers":["should"],"hint":"s _ _ _ _ _","exp":"should."},{"type":"fill","id":"Kamu tidak boleh berlari di kolam.","q":"You ___ run at the pool.","answers":["mustn't","must not"],"hint":"mustn't","exp":"mustn't."},{"type":"fill","id":"Bolehkah saya masuk?","q":"___ I come in?","answers":["may","can"],"hint":"m _ _","exp":"May I."},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Siswa harus tepat waktu.\"","answer":"Students must be on time.","exp":"Students must + kata kerja dasar."},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Kamu sebaiknya tidak makan makanan pedas.\"","answer":"You shouldn't eat spicy food.","exp":"shouldn't + kata kerja dasar."},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa aturan itu?","say":"You must wear a helmet when you ride a motorcycle","options":["Harus memakai helm saat naik motor","Dilarang memakai helm","Sebaiknya memakai helm","Boleh tanpa helm"],"answer":0,"exp":"must wear."},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa izinnya?","say":"May I use the restroom please","options":["Izin menggunakan toilet","Izin pulang","Izin makan","Izin bertanya"],"answer":0,"exp":"restroom = toilet."}],"quiz":[{"type":"mcq","q":"Rambu \"No parking\" artinya kamu...","options":["must park here","mustn't park here","should park here","may park here"],"answer":1,"exp":"No parking = dilarang parkir → mustn't."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Rambu \"Stop\" di lampu merah artinya kamu...","options":["must stop","mustn't stop","don't have to stop","may not stop"],"answer":0,"exp":"Berhenti itu wajib → must."},{"type":"fill","id":"Kamu tidak perlu membawa bekal.","q":"You ___ have to bring lunch.","answers":["don't","do not"],"hint":"don't / doesn't ?","exp":"You → don't have to."},{"type":"fill","id":"Bolehkah aku bertanya?","q":"___ I ask a question?","answers":["may","can"],"hint":"m _ _","exp":"May I ...? / Can I ...?"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Kita harus tepat waktu.\"","answer":"We must be on time.","exp":"Subjek + must + kata kerja dasar."},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan situasi dengan modal:","pairs":[["Kewajiban","must"],["Larangan","mustn't"],["Saran","should"],["Izin","may"]],"exp":"Setiap modal punya fungsi."},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa yang diminta?","say":"May I borrow your dictionary","options":["Izin meminjam kamus","Izin membeli kamus","Memberi kamus","Menanyakan harga kamus"],"answer":0,"exp":"May I borrow ...? = bolehkah aku meminjam ...?"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang benar?","options":["He should to study.","He should studies.","He should study.","He shoulds study."],"answer":2,"exp":"should + kata kerja dasar."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih arti \"What should I do?\"","options":["Apa yang harus kulakukan?","Apa yang sebaiknya kulakukan?","Apa yang sedang kulakukan?","Apa yang akan kulakukan?"],"answer":1,"exp":"should = sebaiknya."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang BENAR tentang don't have to?","options":["Dilarang melakukan","Tidak wajib melakukan","Harus melakukan","Sebaiknya melakukan"],"answer":1,"exp":"don't have to = tidak wajib / tidak perlu."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Rambu \"No smoking\" berarti...","options":["You mustn't smoke here.","You must smoke here.","You should smoke here.","You may smoke here."],"answer":0,"exp":"No smoking = dilarang merokok."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang menyatakan tidak ada kewajiban?","options":["You don't have to come.","You mustn't come.","You must come.","You should come."],"answer":0,"exp":"don't have to = tidak perlu."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang benar?","options":["I can swim.","I can swims.","I can to swim.","I cans swim."],"answer":0,"exp":"can + kata kerja dasar."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih permintaan izin yang paling sopan.","options":["May I use your pen, please?","Give me your pen.","I take your pen.","Your pen now."],"answer":0,"exp":"May I ...?"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Arti \"What should I do?\" adalah...","options":["Apa yang sebaiknya kulakukan?","Apa yang harus kubawa?","Apa yang sedang kulakukan?","Apa yang akan kulakukan?"],"answer":0,"exp":"should = sebaiknya."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Jawaban untuk \"May I come in?\" (tidak) adalah...","options":["I'm sorry, you can't.","Yes, you may.","Sure.","Of course."],"answer":0,"exp":"Menolak sopan."},{"type":"fill","id":"Kamu harus tepat waktu.","q":"You ___ be on time.","answers":["must"],"hint":"m _ _ _","exp":"must."},{"type":"fill","id":"Kamu tidak perlu membawa bekal.","q":"You don't ___ to bring lunch.","answers":["have"],"hint":"h _ _ _","exp":"don't have to."},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Kamu tidak boleh berbicara di perpustakaan.\"","answer":"You mustn't talk in the library.","exp":"mustn't + kata kerja dasar."},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan kalimat dengan makna:","pairs":[["You must wear a helmet.","Wajib"],["You mustn't litter.","Dilarang"],["You should eat vegetables.","Saran"]],"exp":"Wajib, larangan, saran."},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa yang diminta?","say":"May I go to the toilet please","options":["Izin ke toilet","Izin pulang","Izin makan","Izin bertanya"],"answer":0,"exp":"toilet = toilet."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang BENAR?","options":["She must go now.","She musts go now.","She must goes now.","She must going now."],"answer":0,"exp":"must + kata kerja dasar."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca: \"Library rules: You must keep quiet. You mustn't eat or drink. You may borrow three books.\" Berapa buku yang boleh dipinjam?","options":["Tiga","Dua","Lima","Satu"],"answer":0,"exp":"three books."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca dialog: A: \"Must I wear a tie?\" B: \"No, you ___.\"","options":["don't have to","mustn't","shouldn't","can't must"],"answer":0,"exp":"tidak perlu."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana kalimat yang SALAH?","options":["You don't must come.","You don't have to come.","You must come.","You mustn't come."],"answer":0,"exp":"don't must salah."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana kalimat yang SALAH?","options":["He shoulds see a doctor.","He should see a doctor.","She should rest.","I should sleep."],"answer":0,"exp":"should tanpa -s."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Terjemahan \"Sebaiknya kamu minum obat\" adalah...","options":["You should take medicine.","You must to take medicine.","You should takes medicine.","You may take medicine must."],"answer":0,"exp":"should take."},{"type":"fill","id":"Dilarang parkir di sini.","q":"You ___ park here.","answers":["mustn't","must not"],"hint":"mustn't","exp":"mustn't."},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Kamu tidak boleh makan di perpustakaan.\"","answer":"You mustn't eat in the library.","exp":"mustn't + kata kerja dasar."},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan rambu dengan modal:","pairs":[["Wear a helmet","must"],["No smoking","mustn't"],["Drink more water","should"]],"exp":"Rambu dan modal."},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa aturannya?","say":"You mustn't talk in the library","options":["Dilarang berbicara di perpustakaan","Harus berbicara","Sebaiknya berbicara","Boleh berbicara"],"answer":0,"exp":"mustn't."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Arti \"You should see a dentist\" adalah...","options":["Sebaiknya kamu pergi ke dokter gigi.","Kamu harus menjadi dokter gigi.","Kamu dilarang ke dokter gigi.","Kamu boleh ke dokter gigi."],"answer":0,"exp":"should."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Arti \"May I come in?\" adalah...","options":["Bolehkah aku masuk?","Aku harus masuk.","Aku sudah masuk.","Aku akan masuk."],"answer":0,"exp":"May I."}]}